@startuml activity-w2
!include _style.iuml
title W2: Triage, assign, complete and confirm (FR-09–FR-14, TX-2, TX-3)

|Official|
start
:Open report from queue\n(own department only, BR-20);
if (Valid report?) then (no)
  :Reject with reason ≥10 chars (BR-12);
  |CivicLink|
  :SUBMITTED → REJECTED, notify resident;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Official|
:Review & accept (optionally reroute to\nanother active department);
|CivicLink|
:SUBMITTED → UNDER_REVIEW;
|Official|
:Choose field worker + instructions;
|CivicLink|
partition "Transaction TX-2" {
  if (Report already has an active task? (BR-06)) then (yes)
    :Abort: failed-precondition;
    stop
  else (no)
  endif
  if (Worker active and in report's department? (BR-07)) then (no)
    :Abort: invalid-argument;
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  :Create Task ASSIGNED;\nreport → IN_PROGRESS; history;\nnotify worker and resident;
}
|Field Worker|
:Accept task (ASSIGNED → ACCEPTED);
:On site: start (ACCEPTED → IN_PROGRESS);
note right: Skipping a step is refused (BR-08)
:Enter completion notes,\nadd 1–3 proof photos\n(compressed in the browser);
|CivicLink|
partition "Transaction TX-3" {
  if (Notes ≥10 chars and ≥1 proof? (BR-09)) then (no)
    :Abort: invalid-argument;
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  if (Task still the report's active task?) then (no)
    :Abort: failed-precondition\n(task was reassigned);
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  :Task → COMPLETED;\nreport → RESOLVED (resolvedAt);\nhistory; notify resident and official;
}
|Resident|
if (Fixed? (within 7 days, BR-11)) then (yes)
  :Confirm;
  |CivicLink|
  :RESOLVED → CLOSED;
else (no)
  |Resident|
  :Reopen with reason;
  |CivicLink|
  :RESOLVED → UNDER_REVIEW;\nnotify officials;
  note right: returns to triage/assign
endif
stop

|CivicLink|
note
  Hourly schedule: open reports past SLA → ESCALATED (BR-10).
  Daily schedule: RESOLVED > 7 days → CLOSED (BR-11).
end note
@enduml
